      },
      "text": "## Section 1: Infiltration vs. Ventilation"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-VENTILATION.md#006",
      "path": [
        "06-VENTILATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:hvac:06-ventilation, git-history:hvac:06-ventilation]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/06-VENTILATION.md",
        "concepts": "[ventilation]",
        "current_path": "hvac/06-VENTILATION.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ventilation",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ventilation]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ventilation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  INFILTRATION (uncontrolled):\n  - Air leakage through cracks, gaps, penetrations, electrical outlets\n  - Driven by: wind pressure + stack effect (warm air rises, creates\n    positive pressure at ceiling, negative at floor)\n  - Unpredictable, variable, unfiltered\n  - Can draw radon from soil, moisture from crawlspace,\n    exhaust from garage, pollen from outdoors\n  - Measured by blower door: ACH50"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-VENTILATION.md#007",
      "path": [
        "06-VENTILATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:hvac:06-ventilation, git-history:hvac:06-ventilation]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/06-VENTILATION.md",
        "concepts": "[ventilation]",
        "current_path": "hvac/06-VENTILATION.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ventilation",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ventilation]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ventilation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "VENTILATION (controlled):\n  - Intentional introduction of outdoor air\n  - Measured, filtered, often conditioned\n  - Can be paired with heat recovery"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-VENTILATION.md#008",
      "path": [
        "06-VENTILATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:hvac:06-ventilation, git-history:hvac:06-ventilation]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/06-VENTILATION.md",
        "concepts": "[ventilation]",
        "current_path": "hvac/06-VENTILATION.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ventilation",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ventilation]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ventilation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STACK EFFECT:\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │                    ROOF                              │\n  │          +P  warm air exits ↑                        │\n  │                                                      │\n  │ NEUTRAL  ←─────────────────────────────── neutral    │\n  │ PLANE    no pressure differential                    │\n  │                                                      │\n  │          -P  cold air enters ↓                       │\n  │                    SLAB                              │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n  Warm air in house rises → exits through upper gaps →\n  replacement air drawn in at bottom\n  Effect is larger: taller buildings, larger ΔT inside/outside\n```"
    },
