        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ventilation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The design target for whole-house mechanical ventilation:"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-VENTILATION.md#012",
      "path": [
        "06-VENTILATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:hvac:06-ventilation, git-history:hvac:06-ventilation]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/06-VENTILATION.md",
        "concepts": "[ventilation]",
        "current_path": "hvac/06-VENTILATION.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:ventilation",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ventilation]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ventilation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  ASHRAE 62.2 FORMULA:\n  Q_total = 0.01 × A_floor + 7.5 × (N_br + 1)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-VENTILATION.md#013",
      "path": [
        "06-VENTILATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:hvac:06-ventilation, git-history:hvac:06-ventilation]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/06-VENTILATION.md",
