        "title": "Ventilation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Where:\n  A_floor = conditioned floor area (ft²)\n  N_br    = number of bedrooms"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-VENTILATION.md#014",
      "path": [
        "06-VENTILATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
